   "module_16121289240844": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "10px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<ul>\n<li>Create lucrative revenue opportunities</li>\n<li>Increase exclusivity and brand loyalty</li>\n<li>Boost your brand awareness</li>\n<li>Ensure your customers get trusted, superior-quality products</li>\n<li>Easy and affordable startup</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These are just a few of the many benefits private label supplements can bring to your business. Most entrepreneurs and medical practitioners agree that partnering with <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> to build their supplements brand is a win-win for their business and clients.</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
    "child_css": {},
    "css": {},
    "id": "module_16121289240844",
    "label": null,
    "module_id": 1155639,
    "name": "module_16121289240844",
    "order": 9,
    "smart_type": null,
    "styles": {},
    "type": "module"
   },
   "module_16123736011481": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "10px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<p>Hi&nbsp;{{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<p>If you've read our Private Label Guide, you might already be well on your way to taking your business and profits to the next level with your own branded supplements. But if you're still on the fence, don't miss this article that outlines the top benefits, and whether it's right for you.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>As a quick recap: private label supplements refers to putting your brand name on superior-quality supplements, versus making making them yourself. It's a more affordable and less complicated way to offer personalized products to your customers as an ecommerce seller online. You can always start with just one or two products\u2014for as little as $500\u2014 and go from there.</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
    "child_css": {},
    "css": {},
